    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901630/extras/2e6709d4f95520461e4545f92ea06dc4.avif?t=1738559763\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Diverse Stages!</strong> <br>Conquer 10 unique stages, each with its own charm, accompanied by stunning background music and thrilling gameplay. Can you achieve a <i>Perfect Clear</i> on every level? <br> <br>It's time to put your skills to the test!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901630/extras/8d8959ada808c13c6e6df061dc1164c2.avif?t=1738559763\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear Within the Time Limit!</strong><br>Complete each stage within the given time to earn the prestigious <i>Perfect Clear</i> title! But don\u2019t worry if you miss the time limit\u2014clear the stage before the <i>Retire Time</i> and you can still continue your challenge.<br><br>Don\u2019t fear failure\u2014keep pushing forward and go for the win!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901630/extras/2f92639510e911bfbe602e65c96e686b.avif?t=1738559763\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face a Variety of Obstacles!</strong><br>Unpredictable and outlandish gimmicks await to block your path. Overcome these thrilling moments, dodge every obstacle, and strive for victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2901630/extras/c18a00d74682a384119efc315eddd8f0.avif?t=1738559763\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
